          Contact Us for More Insights!
        </h2>
        <p>
          Want to dive deeper? Reach out for personalized assistance and expert
          guidance.
        </p>
      </div>
      <form class="space-y-8" onsubmit="return false;">
        <div class="w-full">
          <label
            class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium"
            for="username"
          >
            Full Name
          </label>
          <div class="relative">
            <input
              type="text"
              class="w-full rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 pe-11 focus:outline-none"
              placeholder="Enter your name here..."
              id="username"
            />
            <span class="icon icon-[tabler--user] absolute inset-e-3 top-1/2 size-6 shrink-0 -translate-y-1/2"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full">
          <label
            class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium"
            for="useremail"
